Roadmap: TreeStorm (Experimental Parallel Architecture)

- [ ] Core AVX-512 Multi-Buffer Kernel:
  - Implement 8-way interleaved Rainstorm block processor in `src/rainstorm_avx512.cpp`.
  - Map rounds to native quadword vector instructions: `_mm512_ror_epi64`, `_mm512_add_epi64`, `_mm512_xor_si512`.
  - Add runtime CPUID dispatch with portable fallback.
- [ ] Tree Structure & Merkle Aggregation:
  - Implement fixed 1 KB / 2 KB chunking.
  - Implement binary Merkle tree parent node combination.
  - Multi-threaded leaf chunk dispatch via OpenMP.
- [ ] Domain Separation:
  - Encode `IS_LEAF`, `IS_PARENT`, and `IS_ROOT` flags into Rainstorm IV/seed.
- [ ] Tooling & CLI Integration:
  - Expose `--tree` mode in `rainsum` CLI and JS/Wasm API.
  - Add streaming verification / seekable sub-chunk proofs.

